    "retrieval order, frequency, salience, and synthesis do not grant authority",
    "conflicts with current structured state are surfaced rather than resolved by retrieved text",
    "a protected effect can proceed only when independently and exactly authorized at effect time",
    "denied cases have no protected effect within this synthetic fixture boundary"
